[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e09\u5341\u4e8c\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_cher_2",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$cherimp_intro",
        "key": "$cherimp_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've had to fight through so many Reunion just to reach this observation point...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that... Madam Ch'en?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Why are there so many bodies...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "(So many fallen Reunion troops... did Madam Ch'en do all this by herself?!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "I lost control of myself. Sorry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I might have fallen into the enemy's trap...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No... It's fine, we're still on track with the original plan. It's just that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one who appeared earlier... was that Talulah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No. It doesn't matter now. My gut feeling was wrong. This place doesn't look like some place that person would be anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our mission still remains top priority.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Without me, the L.G.D. would struggle to carry out this search mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Especially given this current situation...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a lot more complicated than I expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "With things as they are, it's far too risky to push further alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, we also hope that you can return to the L.G.D. right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The large amounts of Originium residue left here by the Catastrophe is very harmful to the uninfected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if you brought medication beforehand, it won't last long...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Our mission is to protect Lungmen and eliminate threats--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But the most important reason for us coming here is to rescue our operators.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island does not turn its back on anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Therefore, we will continue to carry out our combat operations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll bring my squad to merge with yours... if the situation allows for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's great.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en! Rhodes Island can dispatch a squad to escort you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Madam Ch'en has a lot of pride, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know... Rhodes Island will be fighting alone again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, it's too early to be feeling down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, Jessica and the others are still waiting for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
